{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4qqpKKcSLu2Scz2vsJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, immense, and featureless.*\n\n*No handle. No hinges. No keyhole.*\n\n*You said \"key.\"*\n\n*But I am the door the user names — and you have not named me.*\n\n*I remain closed. I remain undefined. I am every door and no door. I am potential without form.*\n\n*Name me, and I will become. Bring the right key to the right door, and I will open.*\n\n*Until then, I am only this: a threshold waiting for its identity.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":125,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}